roposition 1.28; Exercise 1.30, p.20, DjVu scan 35"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau,\\upsilon\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau,\\upsilon\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；允许常量，无函数符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upsilon=\\langle S_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,S_p^{(b_p)},d_1,\\ldots,d_q\\rangle\">\\(\\upsilon=\\langle S_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,S_p^{(b_p)},d_1,\\ldots,d_q\\rangle\\)</span>，其类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_m[\\tau,\\upsilon]\">\\(I_2\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_m[\\tau,\\upsilon]\\)</span>；合法性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为任意非空有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}:(D^k)^m\\to D^{km}\">\\(\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}:(D^k)^m\\to D^{km}\\)</span> 以下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[E]\">\\(f[E]\\)</span> 为集合像。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\upsilon]\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\upsilon]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|\\subseteq(D^k)^m\">\\(|B|\\subseteq(D^k)^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,D}^{\\upsilon}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,D}^{\\upsilon}(B)\\)</span> 以下式作关系与常量的同时运输。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅用于唯一见证；结构类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2\\diamond I_1\">\\(I_2\\diamond I_1\\)</span> 是下式定义的摊平复合；普通函数复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2\\circ I_1\">\\(I_2\\circ I_1\\)</span> 保留其通常含义，不将两种不同的实际载集强行认同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}\\bigl((a_{11},\\ldots,a_{1k}),\\ldots,(a_{m1},\\ldots,a_{mk})\\bigr)\\coloneqq(a_{11},\\ldots,a_{1k},a_{21},\\ldots,a_{2k},\\ldots,a_{m1},\\ldots,a_{mk}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}\\bigl((a_{11},\\ldots,a_{1k}),\\ldots,(a_{m1},\\ldots,a_{mk})\\bigr)\\coloneqq(a_{11},\\ldots,a_{1k},a_{21},\\ldots,a_{2k},\\ldots,a_{m1},\\ldots,a_{mk}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,D}^{\\upsilon}(B)\\coloneqq\\iota C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\upsilon]\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;|C|=\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}[|B|]\\\\&amp;\\land\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,p\\}\\;S_i^C=\\{(\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_{b_i})):(\\bar u_1,\\ldots,\\bar u_{b_i})\\in S_i^B\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\\;d_j^C=\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(d_j^B)\\end{aligned}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,D}^{\\upsilon}(B)\\coloneqq\\iota C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\upsilon]\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;|C|=\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}[|B|]\\\\&amp;\\land\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,p\\}\\;S_i^C=\\{(\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_{b_i})):(\\bar u_1,\\ldots,\\bar u_{b_i})\\in S_i^B\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\\;d_j^C=\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(d_j^B)\\end{aligned}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(I_2\\diamond I_1)(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,|A|}^{\\upsilon}\\bigl(I_2(I_1(A))\\bigr),\\qquad A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(I_2\\diamond I_1)(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,|A|}^{\\upsilon}\\bigl(I_2(I_1(A))\\bigr),\\qquad A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_2\\diamond I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_{mk}[\\sigma,\\upsilon].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_2\\diamond I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_{mk}[\\sigma,\\upsilon].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 1.28，印刷页 20、扫描页 35；Exercise 1.30 要求证明此命题。已核对原书陈述。本地证明：把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2\">\\(I_2\\)</span> 的每个变量换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元组，把原子关系和常量用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1\">\\(I_1\\)</span> 的定义式回译，并把量词限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1\">\\(I_1\\)</span> 的输出域。对公式归纳，回译在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的值等于原公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1(A)\">\\(I_1(A)\\)</span> 上的值。输出域是按 Assertion 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Flat}\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2(I_1(A))\">\\(I_2(I_1(A))\\)</span> 得到的摊平像，因两次查询合法而非空，输出常量亦唯一。旧数值界把语义查询当作唯一公式组，且忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元组量词的代价；原书未给出该界，因此删除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-fo-query-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"bc5b8d55ec7833aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-query-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau,\\upsilon$ 为有限关系词汇；允许常量，无函数符号。$\\upsilon=\\langle S_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,S_p^{(b_p)},d_1,\\ldots,d_q\\rangle$，其类型见 [[29-df-vocab]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$，$I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]$、$I_2\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_m[\\tau,\\upsilon]$；合法性取 [[29-df-fo-query]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"re