\land\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,p\\}\\;S_i^C=\\{(\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(\\bar u_{b_i})):(\\bar u_1,\\ldots,\\bar u_{b_i})\\in S_i^B\\}\\\\&\\land\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\\;d_j^C=\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}(d_j^B)\\end{aligned}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"(I_2\\diamond I_1)(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,|A|}^{\\upsilon}\\bigl(I_2(I_1(A))\\bigr),\\qquad A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma].","display":true},{"tex":"I_2\\diamond I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_{mk}[\\sigma,\\upsilon].","display":true},{"tex":"I_2","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"I_1","display":false},{"tex":"I_1","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I_1(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Flat}","display":false},{"tex":"I_2(I_1(A))","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":3157,"backlinks":[{"id":"5dc6da6f374d15c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 3.9，印刷页48–49、扫描页63–64。语言闭包是其可定义查询集的语义性质；这与“两个 FO 结构查询的复合仍为 FO 查询”是两个不同对象。已有 [[29-prop-fo-closure]] 处理后者，不能代替本定义。$\\mathfrak Q$ 的范围显式给定，使多词汇资源类和固定词汇子问题都能合法使用该接口。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-prop-fo-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["75340800e8905793","bc5b8d55ec7833aa","28e86a5f0243a0ae","0ac4b9a122d458e2","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}